WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.900
Bluebold here! Transition words are road signs.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.860
They tell the reader which way the next sentence is turning.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.560
Put up the wrong sign,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:10.840
and everyone crashes.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.700
There are four main turns.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.940
Contrast, like however or nevertheless.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.380
Continuation, like also or moreover.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.880
Example, like for instance.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.760
And cause and effect,

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.240
like as a result.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.480
The team practiced daily.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.660
Blank. It lost the match.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.780
Hmm. You'd expect practice to help.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:35.880
But they lost!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.300
That's a surprise.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:38.800
That's contrast.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.670
So the sign is nevertheless.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.550
The team practiced daily.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.770
Nevertheless, it lost the match.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.250
Your turn. The bus was late.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:51.010
Blank. I missed class.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:52.710
Which turn is it?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:53.930
Go.

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.430
Cause and effect!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.190
The late bus caused it.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:03.450
As a result fits.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:06.410
Here's the fast way.

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:08.970
Predict the relationship in your own words,

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.550
before you look at the options.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:12.470
Say it. That's a surprise.

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:13.930
Or, that's why.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:15.650
Then look for your match.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.470
One warning. Two facts sitting together don't prove cause

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.090
and effect. Sales rose.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:23.390
The weather was warm.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.570
Therefore? Not unless the passage says so.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.860
Read the sentence before the blank,

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:31.340
and the sentence after.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:32.560
Name the turn.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:33.900
Then pick the sign.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.720
Now hit Try this skill!
